      "writtenOn": "2018-05-23T20:46:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you delay here (proxy for normal preemption) does that mean we lose state in the tcpc that was set up in a higher priority task? This questions goes w/ my comment below on line 281. It seems to me we can be requesting idle when we shouldn\u0027t be.",
      "revId": "43da1a7bb83ff37a63d4393524b64aa9a99ded15",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
