      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I\u0027m missing something still. Yes, we can send i2cidle command and a subsequent access will wake it back up. Will the hardware lose state in that situation where an idle command is sent which drops state that was previous set up?",
      "revId": "43da1a7bb83ff37a63d4393524b64aa9a99ded15",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
